{"productId": "39dcb536-6c1a-4063-953f-7818b62bbb99", "modelName": "P-07", "modelDescription": "A simplification of the CZ 75's hammer ignition method, the Omega's trigger parts are interlocking in nature, allowing full disassembly and reassembly without the need for gunsmithing experience or tools. The best part of this system is its convertible decocker/safety system. Whether the user wants to carry the pistol cocked and locked like a 1911 or decocked for a double-action first pull of the trigger, a few minutes time allows the swapping of the safety for a decocking lever or vice versa. No sharp edges and added forward cocking serrations and interchangeable backstraps. Metal sights, new trigger and hammer designs and a fiber-reinforced polymer rounded out the updates, resulting in a pistol that's even more comfortable for all-day carry, increasingly adaptable to user preferences and hardier than ever before.", "manufacturerName": "CZ-USA", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "f1a0eadf-bb05-4838-99ec-653cad77afdb", "description": "CZ, P-07, DA/SA, Compact, 9MM, 3.75\" Barrel, Polymer Frame, Black Finish, Fixed Sights, 10 Rounds, May Ship With or Without Lanyard Loop\n", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/d4a610e0-608a-40cd-b9fb-18c7f0bda579"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "01086", "upc": "806703010861", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "70cd5184-05d8-42f1-ace2-3bf16911e463", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "396130c4-4fd6-47a6-a0cb-3a79d8f03b06", "valueName": "3.75\""}, {"attributeNameId": "1dbab5b3-c07e-4fd5-93de-487557a9fe2d", "attributeName": "Factory Equipped Sights", "attributeValueId": "15b89746-c931-407f-af1d-ea83c38a6c08", "valueName": "Fixed Sights"}, {"attributeNameId": "cd129f75-5291-4a2c-b112-feeae8b358f8", "attributeName": "Action Type", "attributeValueId": "c28a0dff-71ba-4d18-a0ce-705b5508435c", "valueName": "DA / SA"}, {"attributeNameId": "5484bfc3-10d